Frequency: Daily + weekly
Volume: Network-wide micro-wholesale operations
Owner: MSME Operations Manager
Participants: MSME Ops, DC Ops, Logistics, IT
Source: workflow W2840 — Micro-Wholesale SLA, Exception &amp; Capacity Management</bpmn:documentation>
